    {
      "source": "HOKFIRE",
      "url": "https://www.hokfire.com/",
      "field": "abilities",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "Passive",
          "name": "Frozen Heart",
          "desc": "Upon leaving combat, gains a shield that chills the attacker when taking damage. When the shield disappears, deals damage to nearby enemies. Every third Basic Attack is enhanced, inflicting extra damage and chill effects."
        },
        {
          "type": "Skill 1",
          "name": "Shattered Ice",
          "desc": "Damages and slows enemies in the target area while granting vision of Them."
        },
        {
          "type": "Skill 2",
          "name": "Frigid Prison",
          "desc": "After a brief delay, freezes enemies in the target area and slows them. Attacks on frozen targets deal extra damage."
        },
        {
          "type": "Ultimate",
          "name": "Winter is Here",
          "desc": "Continuously inflicts damage and slow on enemies in the target area."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "HOKFIRE",
      "url": "https://www.hokfire.com/",
      "field": "guide",
      "content": {
        "pros": [
          "Excellent crowd control",
          "Strong AOE damage",
          "Great wave clear to stop pushes"
        ],
        "cons": [
          "Low Mobility",
          "Skillshot reliant",
          "Needs frontline CC to start fights"
        ],
        "gameplay_tips": "## Early Game\nWang Zhaojun has a pretty solid early game. Her wave clear isn't the best early on, but when you rotate, your crowd control can be clutch in skirmishes. Don't waste Frigid Prison Skill 2 for poke. Instead, keep it for setting up kills and punishing enemies who step too far forward.\n\n## Teamfight\nIn teamfights, be patient with Frigid Prison Skill 2 and only use it when you can guarantee it hits an enemy. Usually it's good to wait for your team to use their crowd control, then follow up afterwards. Position yourself in the back line and use your Ultimate Winter is Here to protect yourself and zone enemies.\n\n## Tips & Tricks\nYou can auto-attack whilst standing still to get your enhanced basic attack when you get to lane or at the start of a fight\nUse Skill 1 Shattered Ice to slow enemies, making Skill 2 Frigid Prison easier to hit\nYou can use Skill 1 and Skill 2 to check bushes before enterting them\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "source": "Kurohiko",
      "url": "https://hok.kurohiko.id/",
      "field": "tactical_tips",
      "content": "1) Gerakan lincah buat ngindarin poke dan control Wang Zhaojun. 2) Pas teamfight pakai assassin buat bunuh dia. 3) Simpen control buat motong ult-nya."
    },
